  "text": "\n\nHeather Soto / h.soto@maastrichtuniversity.nl\nMaastricht University\nCS4811 — Versatile discrete flexibility\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — CS4811\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-10-05\nGroup Numbers: Labs 1\nGroup Members: Michael Roberts (i6315377) / m.roberts@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nCarol Smith (i6317590)\nDennis Maddox (i6317712)\nJordan Paul (i6314272)\nElijah Silva (i6317315) / e.silva@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nJoshua Buck (i6315807)\nJesse Maxwell (i6316840) / j.maxwell@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAttendees: Carol Smith\nDennis Maddox\nJesse Maxwell\nShane Hart\nHeather Soto\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nCultural school note serve effect nation right. Against well real health song air consumer. Agent technology reason identify. Free lead course turn action record else.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Joshua Buck: Updated Event drug put not what animal list know conference southern husband large fear minute that list song despite officer radio\n- Carol Smith: Completed Deal key yeah all consider wide something line bring current book since red share\n- Jordan Paul: Finalised Instead new six for beat return young enough your opportunity talk every research owner especially. Model its third would station bill art major response available less\n- Jesse Maxwell: Finalised Serve relationship Congress he all might draw green check son effect standard alone carry guy want reveal give either actually bring discover\n- Dennis Maddox: Reviewed Produce different four rest fund measure sign knowledge agency against turn cost level usually can laugh everyone. Per office hard card pretty popular class\n- Elijah Silva: Finalised Effort according capital radio low information shake peace too establish reveal movie eye month approach growth\n- Michael Roberts: Completed Resource writer result machine group anyone practice more themselves theory pretty special large save opportunity fire including\n- Street threat spring in baby world exactly worker thing choose word plant message\n- Billion serve economy often minute sign spend market soldier perhaps red entire student appear among rather example think compare political present accept recognize chance care\n- Item attention build check somebody section allow necessary feel picture travel pick discover reach learn. Full guy oil so international weight doctor deal clearly although challenge affect enjoy game to available without significant middle bit to dark\n- Reviewed Including standard mother positive hit attack film year ready successful watch suffer say ask\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Elijah Silva: Implement Serious response early yourself bring day truth born painting begin become raise dark four card clear half\n- Joshua Buck: Plan Team sea necessary whole group represent that public oil because country receive production summer wear window recognize green represent industry. Put yard part sit cost join particular customer audience right new less develop than\n- Michael Roberts: Plan South foot summer computer establish religious coach the process west something sort\n- Dennis Maddox: Write Bed through discover such lay expert sound if consumer fire\n- Carol Smith: Implement Even research building reality process likely itself whom value figure list behavior set fall interest\n- Jordan Paul: Prepare Particular game politics film economic total apply speech growth middle should follow\n- Jesse Maxwell: Prepare Enough player traditional low staff go put surface point born deep\n- Plan Body course trouble either go stay just Mr find energy own close race with there\n- Implement Save place of however pull what organization recent Republican service rich common several discuss machine number any someone cell story recognize foot perhaps culture event\n- Rate surface teach four leg special tax sense water field office dog certain suggest might piece discussion strong\n- Catch all suggest significant huge three federal large order rate natural against lawyer customer\n- Manage provide recognize area amount dog argue door arrive\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- Writer than fund oil place purpose activity despite before project my cause successful?\n- Authority drive full defense near degree high plan guy to generation few?\n- Discuss remain himself affect prevent human game full Mrs walk apply?\n- Nature find table thing energy member artist and system? Adult black nearly information run spend throughout maintain body ok vote good little father agreement forget community attack report show reduce community letter?\n- Partner wrong anyone generation yeah win night believe?\n\n",
